# Purpose: Provides the default commit message template for repository contributors.
# Commit Message Format
# Format: [MARKER] Brief summary (50 chars or less)
#
# Markers:
#   [+] Added feature/file/test
#   [-] Removed code/file/dependency
#   [!] Refactored/fixed/changed behavior
#
# Body (optional): List changes, one per line with marker

